# --- BB append-only merge drivers | v2 | 2026-09-01 ---
# TEST_LOG.md is pure append (sampled commits: +57/-0, +80/-0, +69/-0) and carries
# no uniqueness or ordering invariant, so union merge is safe here: it keeps both
# agents rows instead of raising a conflict on the same last line.
#
# VERSION_MATRIX.md and CHANGELOG.md are deliberately NOT union-merged in this
# repo. They encode a version uniqueness/ordering invariant, and union merge
# silently accepts two agents claiming the same version number — verified
# 2026-09-01 by reproducing it. BB_Micro_Bridge can afford union there because
# scripts/lint-version-matrix.mjs fails CI on a duplicate; this repo has no such
# check, so the merge conflict IS the only control. Removing it would be a net
# loss of safety.
#
# SESSION_STATE.md is excluded everywhere: it is rewritten in place, so union
# would duplicate its sections.
**/TEST_LOG.md merge=union
